'''Consumable recipes''' are types of blueprints that unlock [[buildings]], [[weapons]], [[armour]], and [[food]].

They are found around [[Ashenfall]] or inside [[dragonkin vault]]s. Most recipes are found in [[chest]]s, while some recipes are rare drops from monsters.

